<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00598">
	<title>Decreasing set speed</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e03769">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e03770">
								<image href="images/N_SP3i25_B10_048_1_IR.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<p>Push the (<image align="left" href="images/WKIA_335.jpg" scale="15" placement="inline"/>) switch down and release it immediately. The set speed decreases by 1 km/h (1 mph) each time you operate the switch in this manner.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Push the (<image align="left" href="images/WKIA_335.jpg" scale="15" placement="inline"/>) switch down and hold it. The set speed decreases by 10 km/h (5 mph) each time you operate the switch in this manner.</p>
				<p>You can decrease the set speed to 30 km/h (20 mph).</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</conbody>
	<related-links>
		<linkpool>
			<link format="dita" href="t00595.dita#t00595" role="parent" scope="local" type="concept">
				<linktext>Turning on Smart Cruise Control</linktext>
			</link>
		</linkpool>
	</related-links>
</concept>